{"title":"2000 AIME I Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the expansion of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/9/2591337e187b67538692f227ec63184d512bc413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(ax + b)^{2000},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"19\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Relatively_prime\" title=\"Relatively prime\">relatively prime</a> positive integers, the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Coefficient\" title=\"Coefficient\">coefficients</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/e/a6e87b69178d197c13b13d595e7e6817cf20df95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/2/b820233fa1a5accf8aeaeefeb90d298c58b54a78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{3}$\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" /> are equal. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/f/5df6a591474ffd81edd37d8d9f52f6f476caa531.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Binomial_theorem\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Binomial theorem\">binomial theorem</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/a/6ea3327831e803c62f098ee7de934daabd45710c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\binom{2000}{1998} b^{1998}a^2 = \\binom{2000}{1997}b^{1997}a^3 \\Longrightarrow b=666a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"365\" height=\"53\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are positive relatively prime integers, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/2/502e059d1a020b368aee3a99c5669d88331d321f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/3022c4925be2a1fedf4af5d26cc4053b126c6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=666$\" width=\"58\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/1/041f0930a392c55084ac88a9cc89fecc2e14c0ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b=\\boxed{667}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"103\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>Note: The ratio of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/0/540286c0dc6c33d9104432077a0b6fcbc83c6229.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\binom{2000}{1997} b^{1997} a^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"118\" height=\"55\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/9/0996c2d882aee24187edad8585380bbf19b6ba2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\binom{2000}{1998} b^{1998} a^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"118\" height=\"55\" /> can be calculated by writing them as \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/0/01005b4cfb901acb29eefb1e3d6065887975e38d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\frac{2000!}{1997! \\cdot 3!}}{\\frac{2000!}{1998! \\cdot 2!}}.\\]\" width=\"54\" height=\"48\" />\nSimplifying, we get \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/b/0fb959ce23c3443ed9d8118ab0d4d7df3e647b8d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1998! \\cdot 2!}{1997! \\cdot 3!} = \\frac{1998}{3} = 666.\\]\" width=\"190\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/c/92ccb7728d3898f9858435673beff982bcb3ac71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$666$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> is the value for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/2/502e059d1a020b368aee3a99c5669d88331d321f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/1/041f0930a392c55084ac88a9cc89fecc2e14c0ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b=\\boxed{667}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"103\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I\" title=\"2000 AIME I\">2000 AIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2000 AIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2000 AIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2000\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2000 AIME I Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2000 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2000 AIME I Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2000 AIME I Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2000 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2000 AIME I Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2000 AIME I Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2000 AIME I Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2000 AIME I Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2000 AIME I Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2000 AIME I Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2000 AIME I Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2000 AIME I Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2000 AIME I Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2000 AIME I Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2000 AIME I Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" widt